      <syntax><![CDATA[public Vector3 EnvironmentMapSpecular { get; set; }]]></syntax>
      <value><![CDATA[The environment map alpha value.]]></value>
      <remarks><![CDATA[Use this value to implement cheap specular lighting, by encoding one or more specular highlight patterns into the environment map alpha channel, then setting the EnvironmentMapSpecular to the desired specular light color.]]></remarks>
